      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nothing here should be marked as `SK_API`. At most it would be `SK_SPI`, but even that is a stretch. Part of the issue is that there isn\u0027t really a component build of anything other than core Skia at the moment, and path ops was moved out of that so doesn\u0027t have a component build anymore.\n\nAfter talking about this a discussing things, the right solution to all of this is to make almost everything that is currently marked `skia_component` should be `skia_static_library` and then the top level `skia` target be the one `skia_component` which depends on everything else. The end result being that there would be only one `libskia.so` and not be a bunch of not working other shared objects.",
